    <item rdf:about="https://resolutionbazaar.com/doku.php?id=agents:stakeholder_agents:registered_valuers&amp;rev=1744434500&amp;do=diff">
        <dc:format>text/html</dc:format>
        <dc:date>2025-04-12T05:08:20+00:00</dc:date>
        <dc:creator>Anonymous (anonymous@undisclosed.example.com)</dc:creator>
        <title>registered_valuers</title>
        <link>https://resolutionbazaar.com/doku.php?id=agents:stakeholder_agents:registered_valuers&amp;rev=1744434500&amp;do=diff</link>
        <description>Agents for Valuers

REGISTERED VALUERS - Registered valuers assess the fair market value of a corporate debtor’s assets during CIRP. Their valuations guide resolution plans and liquidation strategies to ensure transparency and accountability in asset disposition.</description>
    </item>
